紒浣犱滑姣忎竴浜虹殑鍚嶅瓧閮界墷鐗㈣�板湪涓�澶村績涓�锛岀埍浣犱滑锛�"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "名医贵女", "content_zh": "初到异世 010，搜身苏涟漪白胖的手狠狠攥成了个拳头，捏了又松，一双眼恶狠狠地盯着那群欺凌弱小的恶棍，恨不得冲上去狠狠揍他们。“涟漪，你今儿怎么了？”苏峰发现自家二闺女有些不同，忙问。涟漪长叹了口气，“没什么，刚刚睡觉被三弟吵醒，心情不好。”现在还自身难保，稳定下来再说。其他几人都了然地点点头，虽然今天的涟漪看起来确实有那么点怪，但这“凶残”的眼神却未变。“涟漪大妹子，接下来就麻烦你了，去搜搜那女人和老太婆的身，看有没有钱财。”说话之人叫赵大铁，是三人中稍显年轻的，年纪在二十七八岁，驼背，斜眼，一张嘴一口黄牙，豆大的老鼠眼散发出色迷迷的光。这人虽不能说喜欢涟漪，但总想在年轻姑娘身上占一些便宜。磕头的女人顿了一下，脸白了下来，浑身颤抖着不知该如何是好。涟漪见此，心中料定，家里的钱财想必真在这女人身上，那苏峰欺负人一辈子，也不是好糊弄的。“好。”点了点头，便向可怜的一家人走去。苏峰等人对视一望，笑开了怀，今晚又有酒肉吃了。女人吓坏了，手一松，男孩冲了过来，一下子扑向涟漪，“你这个母夜叉，我和你拼了。”老妪急忙想去阻拦，因太过着急，一口气没喘上来，晕了过去。涟漪一伸手，便将冲过来的男孩推开。可怜的孩子，本应是长身体的时候，却面黄肌瘦，轻轻一推，摔倒在地。“放了我的锦儿，我给……”还没等女人喊完话，苏涟漪一下子捂住了她的嘴，也把她后面的“钱”字捂了回去。借着一个角度，涟漪用自己庞大的身躯挡住身后人的视线。背对着众人，她对女人飞快眨了眨眼，轻声道。“闭嘴。”女人一下子懵了，直觉没说话。涟漪放开她，在众目睽睽之下，像模像样的开始搜身。当碰到女人后腰时，稍稍顿了下，因她摸到了一枚枚圆圆的金属，她料想，这便是铜钱。“没有。”沉声道。“没有！？”苏峰一愣，很是惊讶，凭借他多年坑蒙拐骗的经验，女人身上不可能没钱！别说苏峰等人愣住，就是那女人一家也是呆愣，怎么会……？“没有。”涟漪又冷冷地回了句。“真的？不会是你想独吞吧？”那赵大铁不信，跑了过来，看样子想亲自上手搜女人的身。女人脸色更白，跪着向后退。涟漪一个箭步冲到女人面前，那赵大铁刚刚跑过来，她便一个巴掌甩了过去。“你是个什么东西，敢质疑我苏涟漪！？”这赵大铁身高体健，正是年轻，不去自食其力却跑来行凶打劫。也许是在现代被压抑得久了，苏涟漪觉得自己来到古代后，更是情绪激动。这一巴掌够狠，把赵大铁打得转了几个个，好容易稳下身子，低头吐了一口血，血中还有一只黄牙。“苏涟漪，你别太过分！”名叫王二癞的人跑过去扶住赵大铁，他五十左右年纪，头发花白，本应是德高望重的年纪却眼神轻浮，满脸流气。“敢质疑我二姐，没打死他就偷着乐吧，过什么分？”还没等苏涟漪说话，苏白先冲上来骂了，“平日里要不是我二姐拦着我，我早就揍这小子满地找牙了，总是色迷迷盯着我二姐看，信不信我挖了你的狗眼？”涟漪一挑眉，这三弟，还挺有意思。“色你二姐？”王二癞平日里和赵大铁交好，看见赵大铁被打自然生气，“苏白，老子这是给你爹面子，你撒泡尿照照你们姐弟俩，肥的和猪似的，色你二姐？还不如回家上自家大白母猪来的直接！”“王二癞，你不想活了，敢骂我苏峰的儿子和闺女！”刚刚还置身事外的苏峰一下子火了，他闺女是母猪，那他不就是……苏峰如今老了不可怕，但这苏家姐弟却是打架的好手，就看刚刚苏涟漪那么一下子把人高马大的赵大铁打掉牙便能看出。王二癞自然不敢硬碰硬，狠狠向地上呸了一口，“好，苏峰，你有种，我们走着瞧！”说着，便拽着被打得头晕脑胀的赵大铁离开了。苏峰也向地上呸了一口，狠狠瞪向此时趴在地上的一大家子，“一个铜板都抠不出来，真他马晦气！”说完，便气呼呼的转身走了。苏白拉着涟漪也跟了过去。“我回家了。”涟漪甩开苏白的手，冷冷道。苏白一愣，“姐，咱爹心情不好，咱俩不去哄哄？”涟漪狠狠瞪了苏峰的背影一眼，“要哄你自己哄，他心情不好，我心情还不好呢。”“好好好，知道了二姐，今天打扰你睡觉，把你折腾来还白跑一趟，是我不好，那姐你回去睡吧，我去哄爹，回头我给你买香粉赔不是。”涟漪突然扑哧笑了出来，一是笑着本尊就认识香粉，别人都是用香粉来哄她，二是笑这苏白也是个可爱的人，可惜却走了歪路。姐弟俩分开，一个回家生气，另一个则是去哄自家爹。一场悲剧，就这么奇特的平息。涟漪回家，躺在床上想再睡一会，没想到却怎么也睡不着，想到那家人的贫苦，心中难受得紧，嗓子里如同堵了什么一般难受。在路上，她听苏白说了，那家人姓孙，是后迁入苏家村的外来户，平日里日子过的就紧紧巴巴，当家男人却突然病倒，顶梁柱倒了，非但失了一家主要的劳动力，还因抓药花了不少钱，所以现在的日子，更是贫苦不堪。她虽发过誓不再行医，也自认不是什么大善人，却有最基本的人类良知。这么一躺，就躺了几个时辰，捻转反侧，无法安眠。门开了，那男人回来了，当看到整齐的床上，苏涟漪大白天懒洋洋躺着时，眼中闪过鄙夷和不屑。“你回来了？”涟漪赶忙一个翻身起床，打起了十二分警惕。这男人，似敌非友。“外面有人找。”男人还是惜墨如金。“哦。”涟漪低头整理了下衣服，逃也似的跑了出去。只见涟漪家的院子门外站着两人，一个女人和一个孩童，不是别人，正是刚刚被苏峰欺负的那家人。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－连续失眠三天，晚上睡不着，白天头疼眼睛干，肿么破啊！？T—T", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/mingyiguinu/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "When he first arrived in the different world 010, Su Lianyi's white and fat hands were clenched into fists, and he squeezed and loosened them. He stared at the group of bullies who were bullying the weak with his eyes, and he wanted to rush up and beat them hard. \"Lianyi, what's wrong with you today?\" Su Feng noticed that there was something different about his second daughter and asked quickly. Lianyi let out a long sigh, \"It's nothing. I was woken up by my third brother just now, and I'm in a bad mood.\" It's hard to protect himself now. Let's wait until he stabilizes. Several other people nodded in understanding. Although Ripple looked a little strange today, his \"brutal\" eyes did not change. \"Sister Lianyi, I'll trouble you next. Go search the woman and the old woman to see if they have any money.\" The person who spoke was Zhao Datie, who was slightly younger among the three. He was in his mid-twenties, with a hunchback, slanted eyes, a mouth with yellow teeth, and big rat eyes that gave off a fascinating light. Although this person can't say that he likes Lianyi, he always wants to take advantage of the young girl. The woman who was kowtowing paused for a moment, her face turned pale, and she was trembling all over, not knowing what to do. Seeing this, Lianyi concluded in her heart that the family's money must really belong to this woman, so Su Feng was not easy to fool after he had been bullying people all his life. \"Okay.\" He nodded and walked towards the poor family. Su Feng and others looked at each other and laughed heartily. They had meat and wine again tonight. The woman was frightened, and as soon as she let go of her hand, the boy rushed over and pounced on Ripples, \"You dominatrix, I will fight with you.\" The old woman hurriedly tried to stop him, but was too anxious to catch her breath and fainted. Ripple stretched out his hand and pushed away the boy who was rushing towards him. The poor child, who was sallow and thin when his body should have been growing, fell to the ground with a slight push. \"Release my Jin'er, I'll give...\" Before the woman could finish shouting, Su Lianyi covered her mouth and covered the word \"money\" behind her. Taking advantage of an angle, Lianyi used his huge body to block the sight of the people behind him. With her back to everyone, she blinked quickly at the woman and said softly. \"Shut up.\" The woman was stunned for a moment and said nothing. Lianyi let go of her and began to search her body decently in full view of everyone. When she touched the woman's lower back, she paused for a moment because she touched round pieces of metal. She guessed that these were copper coins. \"No.\" He said solemnly. \"No!?\" Su Feng was stunned, very surprised. With his many years of experience in deceiving and abducting, it is impossible for a woman to have no money! Not to mention Su Feng and others were stunned, even the woman and her family were stunned. How could...? \"No.\" Ripple replied coldly. \"Really? You don't want to take it all for yourself, do you?\" Zhao Dati didn't believe it and ran over, apparently wanting to search the woman himself. The woman's face turned even paler, and she knelt and stepped back. Lianyi rushed in front of the woman, and as soon as Zhao Datie ran over, she slapped him away. \"Who are you? You dare to question me, Su Lianyi!?\" This Zhao Dati was tall and healthy, and he was young. Instead of supporting himself, he came to commit murder and robbery. Perhaps because he had been suppressed for a long time in modern times, Su Lianyi felt that he was even more emotional after coming to ancient times. The slap was so hard that Zhao Dati spun around a few times. He finally regained his balance, lowered his head and vomited a mouthful of blood. There was a yellow tooth in the blood. \"Su Lianyi, don't go too far!\" A man named Wang Erlei ran over to help Zhao Datie. He was about fifty years old, with gray hair. He was supposed to be a respected man at his age, but his eyes were frivolous and his face was full of scorn. \"How dare you question my second sister and have fun without beating him to death? What's wrong?\" Before Su Lianyi could say anything, Su Bai rushed up and scolded him, \"If my second sister hadn't stopped me, I would have beat this kid all over the floor. He always stares at my second sister lustfully. Do you believe I dug your dog eyes?\" Lianyi raised an eyebrow. This third brother is quite interesting. \"Sexing your second sister?\" Wang Erlei was on good terms with Zhao Datie on weekdays. He was naturally angry when he saw Zhao Datie being beaten. \"Su Bai, I'm doing this to save your father's face. You pee and take a look at your two siblings. They are as fat as pigs. Are you lusting after your second sister? It's better to just go home and fuck your own big white sow!\" \"Wang Erlei, you don't want to live. You dare to scold my son and daughter, Su Feng!\" Su Feng, who had stayed out of the matter just now, suddenly became angry. His daughter was a sow, so he is... Su Feng is not scary now that he is old, but the Su family siblings are good at fighting, as can be seen from the way Su Lianyi knocked out the teeth of the tall and powerful Zhao Dati. Naturally, Wang Erlei did not dare to confront him head-on. He spit on the ground and said, \"Okay, Su Feng, you have the guts, let's see!\" With that, he dragged Zhao Dati away who was beaten dizzy. Su Feng also took a sip on the ground and glared at the family lying on the ground. \"I can't dig out a single coin. What a bad luck!\" After saying that, he turned around and left angrily. Su Bai pulled Lianyi and followed him. \"I'm going home.\" Lianyi shook off Su Bai's hand and said coldly. Su Bai was startled, \"Sister, our dad is in a bad mood, why don't we try to comfort him?\" Lianyi glared at Su Feng's back, \"If you want to comfort yourself, he is in a bad mood, and I am still in a bad mood.\" \"Okay, okay, I understand, second sister, I disturbed your sleep today, and all the trouble you got here was in vain. \"Oh, it's my fault. Sister, please go back to sleep. I'll coax daddy. I'll buy you some powder later to make amends.\" Ripple suddenly burst into laughter. Firstly, she laughed because she knew Xiangfen, and others used the powder to coax her. Secondly, she laughed at Su Bai, who was also a lovely person, but unfortunately he went astray. The siblings were separated. One went home to be angry, while the other went to comfort his father. A tragedy, so strangely subsided. Ripple went home and lay on the bed wanting to sleep for a while, but unexpectedly he couldn't fall asleep. Thinking of the poverty of the family, his heart tightened and he felt as if there was something stuck in his throat. on the road", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 10"}